*[[Dual Rocket Laser Helicopter Toilet]]}}The '''Flashlight Rocket Toilet''' is a toilet that has high health and appears on [[Nightmare Mode|nightmare mode]]. It can use its flashlight to area stun. Also deals 500 damage to the base (which means one shoot)

== Appearance ==
The '''Flashlight Rocket Toilet''' is a dark gray toilet with a jetpack, a single flashlight on the bottom, and two green and black rockets.

== Health ==
Wave 35: 610,000 HP

Wave 41: 700,000 HP

== Appearance ==
This toilet has a jetpack, two rocket launchers on the toilets side and a flashlight on the bottom of the toilet.

== Trivia ==
* This toilet is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Geeky_Jesus_Skibidi_Toilet Geeky Jesus Skibidi Toilet].
* In the series the toilet is supposed to be the popular streamer and content creator penguinz0 aka moistcritical, but in the game the toilets head is just the head of a regular toilet. this is most likely, so the games developers don't get into trouble.
